  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nWhen you die, you appear in a cinema with a number of other people who look like you. You find out that they are your previous reincarnations, and soon you all begin watching your next life on the big screen.\n\nYou glance curiously around. The movie hasn't started yet, but you're very interested in the other versions of you around the theater. \nThere is a blond, sporty, buff version of you, that is flirting with two giggling female versions of you that are clinging to his letter jacket. \nThere is an artsy, bespectacled version of you sitting in the back row, who's drawing something on a sketchpad.\nThere is a dark, mysterious version of you with goth makeup and stylish clothing sitting next to a pale, frail-looking version of you who is wearing cut up clothing, with bloodstains. \n\nYou continue looking around the room. Some of the versions are close to the way you are now, but many are very different, of all ages, sexes, hair colors. There appears to be only one constant-your eyes. They are the same hazel green, in each person. \n\nThe seats around you begin to fill.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 48,
  "reference_text": " A matronly version of you, in a gorgeous gown eases herself next to you. \"Come on children\", She says, beckoning her five children, all versions of you at various ages, to fill the seats around you. \"So we get to watch our movie now?\", the youngest says.",
